{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2024-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1730419200, "end_date": 1731023999, "month_true_total": 221, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:05:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "178562338", "author": {"steamid": "76561199764449253", "personaname": "granddaddypurp13055", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199764449253/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 509, "last_played": 1730991035, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game!", "timestamp_created": 1730991057, "timestamp_updated": 1730991057, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178550105", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992680937", "personaname": "Zellith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992680937/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 475, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 474, "last_played": 1732504746, "avatar": "2880af17f6677d75825017c8f6f1729353dac79f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm new to 40K, but not to gaming.  This game is.. tiring.. at times.  Definitely get it on sale.  You'd feel like crap if you paid full price for this one.  \n\nYou're a Space Marine.  Planet under attack.  Pew pew pew.  Die a few times.  Pew pew pew.  Get frustrated.  Pew Pew Pew.  Keep at it.  Pew pew pew.  Progress.  Pew pew pew.  Rinse and repeat.\n\nIt's not really my kind of thing.  The story was a bit flaccid, the characters were decent enough, and very well voiced, but I was still left wondering whether I was playing it wrong.  \n\nThe graphics are okay, although I felt that the world was lacking quite a bit of detail.  Mostly I think you are expected to just walk or fight through the areas as fast as possible.  You're not meant to stand around and smell the roses as it were.\n\nThe music is unremarkable.  I just completed it maybe 15 mins ago and I cant recall a single piece of music.\n\nI never played the multiplayer so I cant comment on that.\n\n(For some reason one of the inquisitors was the same size as a Space Marine.  Thought that was odd based on my understanding of the lore, but yeah I'm probably missing something).\n\nOverall I'd rate it maybe a 5/10.  You can expect to get maybe 6-8 hours out of the campaign.", "timestamp_created": 1730972704, "timestamp_updated": 1730973150, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497487425804138184", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178548254", "author": {"steamid": "76561198391226413", "personaname": "nozz", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198391226413/", "num_games_owned": 109, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 355, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 329, "last_played": 1730992273, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "For the emperor!", "timestamp_created": 1730969001, "timestamp_updated": 1730969001, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1785